# FridgeBuddy architecture

Zero-build GitHub Pages app. Scripts load in order via `index.html`.

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `lib.js` | Pure helpers: catalog, fridge availability, dates, ingredient math |
| `ui-styles.js` | Shared inline style objects (`window.FB_STYLES`) |
| `useFridgeBuddy.js` | All React state, effects, handlers (`window.useFridgeBuddy`) |
| `app.jsx` | Thin shell: tab bar, wires hook to components (~150 lines) |
| `components/HomeTab.jsx` | Home alerts and recipe suggestions |
| `components/GroceryStoreTab.jsx` | Catalog list, add-to-fridge rows |
| `components/FridgeTab.jsx` | Fridge items, search, sort |
| `components/RecipesTab.jsx` | Add recipe form, recipe list |
| `components/RecipeIngredientEditor.jsx` | Shared ingredient row editor |
| `components/RecipeIngredientList.jsx` | Recipe ingredient display with fridge highlighting |
| `components/RecipeCard.jsx` | Shared recipe display (name, quantities toggle, ingredient list) |
| `components/RecipeViewModal.jsx` | Home tab view-recipe modal |
| `components/AddCatalogModal.jsx` | Add grocery item modal |
| `components/EditCatalogModal.jsx` | Edit grocery item modal |
| `components/EditRecipeModal.jsx` | Edit recipe modal |

Components register on `window.FBComponents`. Prefer editing the smallest file that owns the feature.
